  "note": "Extracted by hand from the ordering schematic on page 31, the API flanged forms. Twelve columns assembled bare, with the API 6A ring groove and cone and thread fittings in the connection tables and the API sizes in sixteenths. One conflict is carried rather than resolved: the 0 body configuration prints an asterisk for the HK10, HK20 and HK30 only, yet the sheet's own sample row pairs it with an HK22, so the bracket is enforced and the sample contradiction held for John. The two option positions carry the sheet's own rule, choose any two options in alpha-numerical order, which is recorded but not enforced because the engine has no ordering rule; neither position prints a none row, and the sheet's own sample fills them with a code that appears in no option list, so a build with fewer than two options is held for John.",
